    At first only the flickering outlines are visible. The centre
    box turns a color and shows Pointing or Moving. Concentrating on that group brightens
    the leaves. Hold them green to reveal their true colors.


    Only then answer
    with an arrow key or a swipe. Earlier responses are ignored.'
